    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nCreate a site map for a web app that helps people discover local events, restaurants, and activities.\r\n\r\nYour site map must include:\r\n\r\n- A Homepage\r\n\r\n- At least 3 main sections (for example: Events, Food, Outdoors)\r\n\r\n- At least 2 levels of hierarchy (for example: Home → Events → Concert Details)",
